SpyGhrsJIu7_e_GPBHRKdYBCjuzrks-znkGXQ&oe=6ABA69F6"}, {"file_name": "AssaultOnBase.png", "id": "443113451591277", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982544_443113454924610_3676545296571915906_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9pPog9Yw7RwQ7kNvwE4cKRo&_nc_oc=AdoJUZblJT-d1hspg_PsfqxMxd8dknQhHg9KRUmg3WdZZKsWBnMxIfddtMS8oQ8dj8Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJc2QxKT3kLghViLrfFY44KsEwjew8lmM9PI7PthCcm8w&oe=6ABA6646"}, {"file_name": "Labyrinth.png", "id": "1300393411339063", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982674_1300393414672396_5204739748604220557_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dfcZgMer0LAQ7kNvwEpXf1-&_nc_oc=AdqbOgoyVcA8emA-WmTK5FYK91yIwB7rLWRiX93DvDdXlHSchOnJbz6qrko4a63mdeE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJn9GsPz9sHFWG8IWtDpXhnYLtelrelqHbPJSEceNO8WQ&oe=6ABA7408"}, {"file_name": "Turret.png", "id": "2302745436726053", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974751_2302745440059386_4335230081335400553_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Lme6EV9jOQAQ7kNvwETZVWH&_nc_oc=AdrDRNt8H0ziNfhOSS6iN6t95J8xZHxHiLebONLnA9ToUBUXoVMV-UZJRQKfIU5nRIA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLYNexEPWRsD_LB8tIl_IseMT9aoi2VHbvin4fIM8wVOA&oe=6ABA61DF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverArtLandscape.png", "id": "1083730483394050", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86615253_1083730486727383_4084447030365624247_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kok7WHybPYUQ7kNvwFS3DKQ&_nc_oc=Adp5mGsInFDOaUcLoZcB4haw1N4ziSxN3PkVPfQ5RrZt_SiHvsatxN0qBj9VHuiC71Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI-nuHSoTOw6V1nkRIQNJnWgDr8ZwCZpSKgsIgsalY_Hw&oe=6ABA7AAB"}, "display_name": "Catastrophic Inversion", "keywords": ["Arena", "Laser", "Cyber", "Huge", "Neon"], "long_description": "Catastrophic Inversion is a VR laser-tag experience built for large spaces, like the gym at your school or community center.\nInstead of using a joystick or teleporting, you **walk naturally around the maps**, alongside the other players.\nWith two simple taps to calibrate, everyone is lined up and ready to go.\n\n**PLEASE NOTE:** in order to play in shared space on maps larger than 33' x 33'. you will need to have your headset in **Developer Mode** so you can temporarily disable the Guardian boundary.\nThis can be done in the **Headset Settings** on the **Meta Horizon** mobile app. You will need to create a meta developer account, but anyone can do this even if they aren't a developer.\n\n**Take on your friends** in several exciting locations in a **neon cyber world!**\n\n- One-time setup of a space takes only a few minutes.\n- If you don't have a large space, you can play in joystick mode.\n- Multiplayer is hosted locally and can be done without an internet connection. (LAN Wi-Fi connection still required.)\n\nCatastrophic Inversion is still in early access. There are some quality-of-life updates and much more content on the way, but currently the game offers:\n- Four Weapon Types (Including Powered Turrets)\n- Customizable Game Modes (CTF/Deathmatch/Elimination, timed/scored, teams/free-for-all)\n- Two 89' x 50' maps\n- One 79' x 46' map\n- One 33' x 33' map\n- One 10' x 10' demo platform for testing the Shared Space features at home.", "short_description": "Grab your friends, bring your headsets, and head to the biggest space you can find!\n\nCatastrophic Inversion is a cyber-themed shooter that allows you to turn any large space into an immersive multiplayer VR experience rivaling professional venues."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.toastidwaffel.com/policies", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.toastidwaffel.com/policies", "publisher_name": "Toastid Waffel", "support_website_url": "https://www.toastidwaffel.com/about-us", "